      "id": "2105721630051692804",
      "text": "For two weeks, start a design, deck, or doc in the Claude app, and the work that follows in that conversation uses 50% less of your usage limits.\n\nGive it a try with Claude Sonnet 5.5. It has a strong eye for design and builds slides that need minimal editing.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:08:53.000Z",
      "is_quote_status": true,
      "author": "claudeai",
      "likes": 7802,
      "replies": 294,
      "retweets": 419,
      "bookmarks": 2793,
