        "state": "EnabledWithCount"
      },
      "quoted_url": "https://twitter.com/claudeai/status/2100258492590207079",
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2100258492590207079",
        "text": "You can also now make decks, docs, and designs in your conversation.\n\nDraft the one-pager in Claude Docs, turn it into a deck with Claude Slides, and mock up a matching visual in Claude Design, all from one place. https://t.co/Y0JaJGT3G8",
