      "id": "2104641323198472430",
      "text": "Sonnet 5.5 is available now in the Claude Platform and Claude Code.\n\nWe granted all Pro, Max, and Team users a reset last Tuesday. If you haven’t used it yet, you can still apply it whenever you want, before Oct 22. https://t.co/5OZYmPGdcK",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T18:36:08.000Z",
      "is_quote_status": false,
      "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "2104641322137293209",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name": "ClaudeDevs",
      "author": "ClaudeDevs",
      "likes": 290,
      "replies": 70,
      "retweets": 6,
      "bookmarks": 79,
      "views": {
        "count": 161036,
        "state": "EnabledWithCount"
      },
      "quoted": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2102871554069774451",
      "text": "The credit is separate from your usage limits, and it applies automatically once you start a cloud session.\n\nIf you hit a limit locally, keep going in the cloud until your credit runs out. One credit per account, for cloud sessions only.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T21:23:42.000Z",
      "is_quote_status": false,
      "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "2102871552849322082",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name": "ClaudeDevs",
      "author": "ClaudeDevs",
      "likes": 488,
      "replies": 8,
      "retweets": 9,
      "bookmarks": 89,
      "views": {
        "count": 384132,
        "state": "EnabledWithCount"
      },
      "quoted": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2102438803013333469",
      "text": "If you're on Pro, Max, or Team, your reset is available today in Settings → Usage. Apply it any time until Oct 22.\n\nOpus 5.5 is the default for paid plans. It's priced lower than Opus 5, so your 5-hour and weekly limits go 25% further.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T16:44:06.000Z",
      "is_quote_status": false,
      "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "2102438800836489554",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name": "ClaudeDevs",
      "author": "ClaudeDevs",
      "likes": 1895,
      "replies": 78,
      "retweets": 114,
      "bookmarks": 216,
      "views": {
        "count": 380261,
        "state": "EnabledWithCount"
      },
      "quoted": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2102438800836489554",
      "text": "Opus 5.5 performs at the level of Fable 5.1. It's ~30% faster and ~40% cheaper than Opus 5 per task.\n\nIn Claude Code:\n- 5-hour session limits increase 20% today\n- Opus 5.5 is priced lower, so it goes 25% further within limits\n- Pro, Max, and Team users get a reset to use anytime https://t.co/1seRYKAtzJ",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T16:44:06.000Z",
      "is_quote_status": true,
      "author": "ClaudeDevs",
      "likes": 16293,
      "replies": 465,
